  "guid": "com.vultify.fastgrenadethrow",
  "name": "Fast Grenade Throw",
  "slug": "fast-grenade-throw",
  "teaser": "Brings back the classic instant grenade throw with dedicated key binds for overhand and underhand quick throws.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/EodL3DCMnBkrjfkHRmGizPqFDnHv4EKhWFcclLrj.jpg",
  "downloads": 2670,
  "favourites_count": 24,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Brings back the classic instant grenade quick throw from earlier Tarkov patches. Press a key and your grenade flies — no equipping, no holding, no waiting.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Instant overhand throw</strong> — one key press, grenade gone</li>\n<li><strong>Instant underhand throw</strong> — separate keybind for low trajectory tosses</li>\n<li><strong>Your normal grenade key is untouched</strong> — no conflicts with vanilla controls</li>\n<li><strong>Backpack, armband, and secure container support</strong> — finds grenades anywhere on you, not just your rig/pockets</li>\n<li><strong>Use Items Anywhere compatible</strong> — detects UIA and hooks into its slot system instead of conflicting with it</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>How it works</h3>\n<p>The mod uses the game’s built-in QuickGrenadeThrowHandsController — the same system BSG originally built for fast throws. It automatically finds the highest-priority grenade you’re carrying and throws it instantly, then returns you to your previous weapon.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instructions</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Extract the archive</li>\n<li>Drop the <code>BepInEx</code> folder into your SPT root directory</li>\n<li>Launch the game — default keybinds are <strong>G</strong> (overhand) and <strong>H</strong> (underhand), configurable via F12</li>\n</ol>\n<p>⚠️ <strong>Recommendation:</strong> If your normal grenade keybind is also G, change one of them to avoid conflicts. Either rebind your vanilla grenade key in-game, or change the quick throw key in the F12 config menu.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Limitations / Bugs</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><strong>Conflicts with Janky’s Visual Assist:</strong> its Grenade Arc feature overrides the real throw with its own predicted trajectory, which can be stale during a quick throw. Symptom: the grenade appears to vanish, then explodes far away instead of where thrown. <strong>Workaround:</strong> disable “Grenade Arc” in Janky’s Visual Assist’s F12 settings.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Found a bug or have a question? Leave a comment on this mod’s page, or reach out in my thread on the SPT Discord:\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521972310595338260\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521972310595338260</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
