      "version": "1.0.4",
      "description": "<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Fixed phantom grenade throws — the mod was using a broad inventory sweep that bypassed the game’s own system, so grenades were thrown but never removed from inventory</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fixed wrong grenade being selected — the same broad sweep returned grenades in an unpredictable order that didn’t match the HUD, causing a different grenade to be thrown than the one displayed</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added automatic <strong>Use Items Anywhere</strong> detection — without this both mods would fight over the same grenade selection code, potentially causing conflicts or one overriding the other</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added debug logging toggle in F12 — there was previously no way to see what the mod was doing internally, making user-reported issues difficult to diagnose</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2783/fast-grenade-throw/1.0.4",
